# Built packages (npx @vscode/vsce package) are not kept in the repo.
*.vsix
# Written by the workbench at run time -- local, not part of the repo.
# Pipeline output (state.json, graphs, artifacts):
workbench_output/
# Hugging Face weight cache (can be gigabytes); .w/ is the short-path variant used
# on Windows when long paths are disabled:
.ai_compiler_cache/
.w/
# Generated model code and its review.json (commit a model's folder deliberately if you want it in git):
generated/
# The workbench's own nntrainer build (meson/ninja, MSVC on Windows) and the venv
# holding meson + ninja for it:
nb/
.buildenv/
# Host-side copies of the Docker build's build.ninja / compile_commands.json and
# the manifest of the checkout copy in its volume (anchored, so the source folder
# extension/engine/docker with the build's Dockerfile stays tracked):
/docker/
